{"page":237,"verses":[{"verse_key":"12:15","surah":12,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا ذَهَبُوا۟ بِهِۦ وَأَجْمَعُوٓا۟ أَن يَجْعَلُوهُ فِى غَيَـٰبَتِ ٱلْجُبِّ ۚ وَأَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْهِ لَتُنَبِّئَنَّهُم بِأَمْرِهِمْ هَـٰذَا وَهُمْ لَا يَشْعُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Then they took him away with them, resolved upon throwing him into the hidden depths of a well- We inspired him, saying, ‘You will tell them of all this [at a time] when they do not realize [who you are]!’-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"So when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ذَهَبُوا۟","en_gloss":"they took him","transliteration":"dhahabū","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"they took him","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَأَجْمَعُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and agreed","transliteration":"wa-ajmaʿū","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَجْعَلُوهُ","en_gloss":"they put him","transliteration":"yajʿalūhu","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"غَيَـٰبَتِ","en_gloss":"(the) bottom","transliteration":"ghayābati","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْجُبِّ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the well","transliteration":"l-jubi","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَأَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"But We inspired","transliteration":"wa-awḥaynā","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَتُنَبِّئَنَّهُم","en_gloss":"Surely, you will inform them","transliteration":"latunabbi-annahum","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِأَمْرِهِمْ","en_gloss":"about this affair","transliteration":"bi-amrihim","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"about this affair","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"12:15"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","ve